      m_Calls: []
  m_text: '<size=130%><b><color=#ffd970>AREA 8 - UI & TRIGGERS</color></b></size>

    A
    dungeon vault: <b>Trigger Zones</b> that show messages and count rooms, a <b>Press-E</b>
    lever, <b>collectable gems</b> with a counter, and a <b>gate</b> that opens when
    you have them all.


    <b><color=#9fe3ff>TRY THIS</color></b>

    <size=92%>1.
    Change the gate so it opens with only 2 gems.

    2. Add a 4th room trigger
    and set Total Wings to 4 on the UI.

    3. Make the treasure trigger also switch
    the torches off.</size>'
